cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use RELIC in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "RELIC: Execution-Grounded Behavioral Analysis for Legacy Software Modernization"
abstract: >
  RELIC recovers implicit behavioral obligations from legacy JCL/COBOL systems as
  Behavioral Contract Graphs (BCG = (V, E, C, P, D, Γ)), compares them across
  modernized versions using confidence-delta differencing, and uses execution
  evidence to distinguish supported, conflicting, and unobserved behavior.
  Evaluated on the AWS CardDemo benchmark: BCG F1=1.000 vs structural baseline
  F1=0.8995 across 104 evaluated mutations; 91.8% dynamic validation rate.
